# Global excludes installed by the dotfiles git package.
#
# worktree-slot / worktree-claim runtime files (see worktrees/ package,
# docs/worktree-slots.md, docs/tasks/tmux-remote-workspaces/initial-plan.md).
# These are generated/ignored private state, never repository-owned config,
# so they are ignored globally instead of requiring every opted-in
# repository to add its own .gitignore entry.
.worktree-claim
.worktree-slot.json

# NOT listed here: the per-repo development ports file (`ports_file` in
# worktrees/config.json, e.g. content-engine's `.env.ports`). That filename is
# declared and owned by the repository, so the repository ignores it in its own
# .gitignore -- a developer reading that repo should be able to see the file is
# expected and generated without knowing these dotfiles exist.

**/.claude/settings.local.json
